  'Design, engineering, AI': 'Dizayn, dasturlash, AI',
  "Arise is a study and career-guidance ecosystem for students in Uzbekistan. It connects a student's ambition to a concrete route: university matching, skill-building and an AI mentor who knows the path.": 'Arise — O‘zbekiston yoshlari uchun o‘qish va kasb tanlash platformasi. U orzuni aniq rejaga aylantiradi: universitet tanlash, ko‘nikmalarni rivojlantirish va yo‘lni yaxshi biladigan AI-murabbiy.',
  "Ari, the platform's multilingual mentor, constructs milestones around each goal and stays inside the product's guardrails. The result is guidance that feels personal without inventing facts.": 'Platforma murabbiyi Ari har bir maqsadni bosqichlarga bo‘ladi va belgilangan chegaradan chiqmaydi. Maslahatlar shaxsiy bo‘ladi, lekin o‘ylab topilgan faktlarsiz.',
  'Personal admissions roadmap, matched to dream universities': 'Orzudagi universitetga kirish uchun shaxsiy reja',
  'Gamified skill trees, streak rituals and milestone tracking': 'O‘yin shaklidagi ko‘nikmalar daraxti, kunlik seriyalar va bosqichlar',
  'Native mobile performance with offline resilience': 'Tez ishlaydigan va internetsiz ham ishlay oladigan ilova',
