  'Planning an education, health or AI product?': 'Ta’lim, tibbiyot yoki sun’iy intellekt bo‘yicha mahsulot rejalashtiryapsizmi?',
  'Talk to the founders': 'Asoschilar bilan gaplashish',
  'Catalogue': 'Katalog',
  '713 books': '713 ta kitob',
  'Digital reading in Central Asia was split between disordered Telegram channels and archaic portals that were never built for a phone. DigitalLib replaces both with one coherent reading space.': 'Markaziy Osiyoda elektron kitoblarni tartibsiz Telegram kanallari va telefonda noqulay eski saytlardan qidirishga to‘g‘ri kelardi. DigitalLib hammasini bitta qulay joyga jamlaydi.',
  'The platform combines a verified national catalogue, a private academic vault, an adaptive reader with text-to-speech, and an arena of chapter-level quizzes. It is fast enough to work where the network is not.': 'Platformada tekshirilgan milliy katalog, o‘qish uchun shaxsiy ombor, matnni ovozda o‘qib beradigan o‘quvchi va har bir bob bo‘yicha viktorinalar bor. Internet zo‘rg‘a ishlaydigan joyda ham tez ishlaydi.',
